**New Evidence**
- [President Jokowi Orders Thorough Investigation on Kanjuruhan Tragedy](https://setkab.go.id/en/president-jokowi-orders-thorough-investigation-on-kanjuruhan-tragedy/) - Jokowi ordered a thorough investigation into the Kanjuruhan tragedy, said sanctions should be imposed on those guilty, and directed relevant ministries and the National Police to investigate and identify the perpetrators.
